{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>And you shall make the altar… and three cubits its height.</b> The words stand as written — the words of Rabbi Yehudah. Rabbi Yosei says: רָבוּעַ is stated here, and רָבוּעַ is stated for the inner altar; just as there its height is twice its length, so too here its height is twice its length. And how do I fulfill ״וּשְׁלֹשׁ אַמּוֹת קֹמָתוֹ״? From the edge of the surround and above (Zevachim 59)."], :book :exodus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 27, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:54:53.050130097Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}